name: ['Blastoderm', 'Cabal Therapy', 'Circle of Protection: Red', 'Counterspell', 'Duress', 'Fact or Fiction', 'Flametongue Kavu', 'Icy Manipulator', 'Juggernaut', 'Kird Ape', 'Rancor', 'Seal of Cleansing']
