text: ['Choose a nonland card name. Target player reveals their hand and discards all cards with that name.\\nFlashback—Sacrifice a creature. (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Counter target spell.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0 and has trample.\\nWhen Rancor is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Rancor to its owner's hand.", "Juggernaut attacks each combat if able.\\nJuggernaut can't be blocked by Walls.", 'Kird Ape gets +1/+2 as long as you control a Forest.', 'Reveal the top five cards of your library. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', 'Sacrifice Seal of Cleansing: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nFading 3 (This creature enters the battlefield with three fade counters on it. At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a fade counter from it. If you can't, sacrifice it.)", 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a noncreature, nonland card from it. That player discards that card.', 'When Flametongue Kavu enters the battlefield, it deals 4 damage to target creature.', '{1}, {T}: Tap target artifact, creature, or land.', '{1}: The next time a red source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.']
flavor: ['"For dim-witted, thick-skulled genetic mutants, they have pretty good aim."\\n—Sisay', '"I am the purifier, the light that clears all shadows."\\n—Seal inscription', '"It was probably a lousy spell in the first place."\\n—Ertai, wizard adept', '"We decide who is worthy of our works."\\n—Gix, Yawgmoth praetor', 'Hatred outlives the hateful.', 'In fire there is the spark of chaos and destruction, the seed of life. In ice there is perfect tranquility, perfect order, and the silence of death.', 'It puts the "fur" in "fury."', 'We had taken refuge in a small cave, thinking the entrance was too narrow for it to follow. To our horror, its gigantic head smashed into the mountainside, ripping itself a new entrance.']
artist: ['Christopher Moeller', 'Dan Frazier', 'Douglas Shuler', 'Eric Peterson', 'Ken Meyer, Jr.', 'Kev Walker', 'Lawrence Snelly', 'Mark Poole', 'Mark Tedin', 'Pete Venters', 'Ron Spencer', 'Terese Nielsen']
